{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hyperons: Explore the Depths of the Universe!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an epic sci-fi saga where the survival of the galaxy rests in your hands. After a devastating invasion, you find yourself stranded on a hostile planet. But this is just the beginning of your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Galaxy:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover countless planets with unique biomes, resources, and dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own base, develop advanced technologies, and upgrade your spaceship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the resistance, fight against the invaders, and forge alliances with other species.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the secrets of ancient technologies and use their power to save the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hyperons offers:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A captivating survival experience with crafting, base building, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic sci-fi story full of intrigue, danger, and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A vast galaxy that offers endless possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ability to form alliances with various alien species.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense space battles and ground combat against the invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you become the savior of the galaxy, or will you succumb to the dangers of the universe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hyperons \u2013 Your adventure begins now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2479500?t=1743079059","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.st